<title>USA: Insiders buy 65,000 shrs American Science.</title>
<headline>Insiders buy 65,000 shrs American Science.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Science &amp; Engineering Inc said Monday that five of its officers and directors have invested $381,875 to completely exercise a class of warrants to purchase 65,000 shares of AS&amp;E common stock.</p>
<p>The warrants, said the company, were issued in connection with a loan made by the five insiders to AS&amp;E in 1995.</p>
<p>AS&amp;E develops and manufactures X-ray inspection products for critical detection and security applications.</p>
</text>
